<p>King Charles III and Queen Camilla visited the National 9/11 Memorial in lower Manhattan on Wednesday, placed a floral tribute and met victims&#x27; relatives, first responders and local dignitaries during the New York portion of their four-day U.S. trip. The visit was part of a diplomatic tour tied to the 250th anniversary of American independence. Michael Bloomberg, the former New York mayor and chairman of the 9/11 Memorial and Museum, accompanied the couple at the memorial, where they also met New York City Mayor Zohran Mamdani. Afterward, their schedule included a Harlem community organization, the New York Public Library, a business event and an evening gala or cultural reception. Before New York, Charles addressed Congress, met privately with President Trump and attended a White House state dinner in Washington. Coverage of the visit also cited Trump&#x27;s criticism of Prime Minister Keir Starmer over what Trump described as a lack of help in the U.S. and Israel&#x27;s war with Iran.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/uhQfSh_RR1zyca629r6DzMAUsa4Gq6gr3stMuCTXh19FWnXUvahNxc5smiWUQBDEliiPBKHU9P1Xz5fDftdYWJCZl3LmH9RpKgzvabScBSiPtF2SGXZeWkwYD-wHdjimrH1Au3n6Ri9wIETw3koIk-crfnU3GMmmztYrh9VGCJQdjJjvpYm4e54b-hsJIP2m3KsUFUr4UMnweJcE_IG4lc6KlDm6mc6uaf0rDQ_-yUc-OdVawsA3c8ARIcWTqm_wGqcDVPY' alt='Michael Bloomberg, chairman of the National September 11 Memorial, King Charles III and Queen Camilla after depositing flowers at one of the memorial pools on April 29, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Anniversary timing: Reports said the memorial ceremony took place ahead of the 25th anniversary of the September 11 attacks in 2026.</li><li>Harlem detail: At a community project in Harlem, Charles fed chickens during the Manhattan itinerary.</li><li>State visit: Reports identified the New York stop as part of Charles&#x27;s first state visit to the United States since becoming king.</li></ul><blockquote>We honour the memory for those who so tragically lost their lives on 11th September 2001. - King Charles III and Queen Camilla</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Buckingham Palace: Buckingham Palace said King Charles was mindful of the UK government&#x27;s long-standing position on preventing nuclear proliferation, but was not a spokesman for the government, after President Trump said Charles had told him he did not want Iran to possess nuclear weapons. (<a href='https://minutemirror.com.pk/king-charles-to-honor-9-11-victims-in-new-york-547818/'>Minute Mirror</a>)</li><li>President Trump: President Trump criticized Prime Minister Keir Starmer, saying Starmer had not provided enough help in the U.S. and Israel&#x27;s war with Iran. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3351917/king-charles-commemorates-9/11-victims-new-york-visit'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li><li>Downing Street: Downing Street declined to comment on President Trump&#x27;s remarks about what King Charles had said on Iran&#x27;s nuclear program. (<a href='https://minutemirror.com.pk/king-charles-to-honor-9-11-victims-in-new-york-547818/'>Minute Mirror</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/29/world/europe/king-charles-camilla-royals-nyc-visit.html'>British Royals Crisscross Manhattan in Brief Visit Packed With Photo Ops</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/video-king-charles-and-queen-camilla-honour-victims-at-911-memorial-in-new/'>King Charles and Queen Camilla honour victims at 9/11 Memorial in New York</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/king-charles-commemorates-9-11-victims-in-new-york-visit/a-76987864'>King Charles commemorates 9/11 victims in New York visit</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3351917/king-charles-commemorates-9/11-victims-new-york-visit'>UK’s King Charles commemorates 9/11 victims in New York visit</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/